    "text": "A stone of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>kg</mi></math> is tied to end of a massless string of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. If the breaking tension of the string is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>, then maximum linear velocity, the stone can have without breaking the string, while rotating in horizontal plane, is:",
